flowchart TB
  USER["YOUR ORDINARY CLAUDE PROMPT<br/>User demands same quality, absolute minimum Pro usage"] --> DIRECTOR["UBERMIND OMEGA13 • 5% REALITY ENGINE<br/>One Claude Code owner; all 5-hour and weekly usage counted"]
  IDENTITY["WESSAM SINGULARITY -> SOVEREIGN CONTINUUM<br/>PERSONAL CIVILIZATION -> UBERBOND -> UBERMIND"] -. "Founder authority and entire objectives" .-> DIRECTOR
  DIRECTOR --> CONTRACT["01 ACCEPTANCE / PROVENANCE CONTRACT<br/>Exact task SHA • required quality • current source<br/>Permissions • independent held-out tests"]
  GENOME["ALL 890 ORIGINAL FOUNDER IDEAS + GENESIS<br/>TOTAL BRAIN • PHOENIX • NEGATIVE KNOWLEDGE<br/>CAPABILITY GENOME • SKILL IMMUNE SYSTEM<br/>World / life / science / economy / commercial organs"] -. "Minimum relevant sources, never delete originals" .-> CONTRACT
  CONTRACT --> PRE["02 NATIVE PREFLIGHT (NO MODEL DISPATCH)<br/>node scripts/ubermind-five-percent-preflight.mjs<br/>Existing exact source auditor + W30 context bytes"]
  PRE --> SCOPE{"03 DOES EXACT SOURCE PROOF SATISFY<br/>THIS SPECIFIC TASK CONTRACT?"}
  SCOPE -- YES --> REPLAY["E0-E4 EXACT REPLAY<br/>Native code / JSON pointer / hash / test<br/>Zero ADDITIONAL generative inference on this unit"]
  SCOPE -- NO --> LEARNED["04 SEMANTIC NO-REDO GRAPH<br/>Cognitive multicast • shared subexpression elimination<br/>Incremental decision DAG • negative knowledge<br/>Crown call coalescing • PHOENIX source freshness"]
  LEARNED --> JUDGE{"05 TYPED NOUL / CHOICE / SCORE?"}
  JUDGE -- "Strict $20: use local rules" --> LOCAL["LOCAL JEV-STYLE DECISION RULES<br/>No external model, no new paid invoice"]
  JUDGE -- "Independent explicit provider authority" --> JEV["EXISTING JEV 1.13 / W11–W22<br/>Governed tensor, scoped proof, budget lock"]
  JEV --> ROUTER
  LOCAL --> ROUTER{"06 CHEAPEST PROVEN QUALITY-PRESERVING ROUTE?<br/>Real metering & actual availability outrank API tariffs"}
  ROUTER -- "Routine small change" --> SOLO["SONNET 5.5 SINGLE ENGINEER<br/>Tools and tests first • compact output"]
  ROUTER -- "Bounded read-only source task" --> SCOUT["HAIKU 5.5 READ/GREP/GLOB<br/>Existing max-six-turn scout • source receipts"]
  ROUTER -- "Novel / consequential / unresolved" --> CROWN["OPUS 5.5 FRONTIER CROWN<br/>Deep reasoning only for the hard semantic delta"]
  SCOUT --> SPEC["07 MINIMUM RELEVANT CONTEXT PACKET<br/>Source SHA • task DAG • exact acceptance checks"]
  CROWN --> SPEC
  SPEC --> FAN{"08 WOULD PARALLEL PEERS COST LESS<br/>AT IDENTICAL ACCEPTED QUALITY?"}
  FAN -- "No, default" --> SOLO
  FAN -- "Independence plus observed benefit" --> TEAM["OPTIONAL SONNET BUILDER + FALSIFIER<br/>Haiku only if worth complete shared usage"]
  TEAM --> DELTA["09 SEMANTIC-DELTA ONLY<br/>Changed files, failed tests, unresolved claims<br/>No full transcript restream"]
  SOLO --> DELTA
  DELTA --> GAP{"10 HARD FRONTIER FAILURE?"}
  GAP -- YES --> REVIEW["OPUS REVIEW OF RESIDUAL ONLY<br/>Do not downgrade required reasoning"]
  GAP -- NO --> REALITY
  REVIEW --> REALITY["11 REALITY COURT<br/>Independent quality tests, source/permission checks"]
  REPLAY --> REALITY
  REALITY --> PASS{"REQUIRED QUALITY, SOURCE AND EFFECTS ACCEPTED?"}
  PASS -- NO --> FIX["Repair/hold/escalate. A cheap failure is not a saving"]
  PASS -- YES --> DONE["12 FINISHED ACCEPTED WORK"]
  DONE --> PERSIST["13 PHOENIX PROOF ECONOMY<br/>Certified task-specific reuse with source lineage<br/>Preserve all original 890 and GENESIS"]
  PERSIST -. "Next matching task can bypass inference" .-> SCOPE
  DONE --> CALC["14 FIVE-HOUR BREAK-EVEN MATH<br/>U = F + (100-F)*(1-R)*M + H<br/>F unavoidable, R verified reused share<br/>M measured residual factor, H overhead"]
  CALC --> TARGET{"U ≤ 5% AND INDEPENDENT QUALITY HOLDS?"}
  TARGET -- "Measured yes" --> PROMOTE["PROOF-CARRYING TASK-CLASS POLICY PROMOTION"]
  TARGET -- "No data / no quality parity" --> UNKNOWN["CLAUDE USAGE: UNKNOWN<br/>5% NOT ACHIEVED; never invent"]
  PROMOTE -. "Empirical feedback changes only matching routes" .-> ROUTER
  BASE["CLAUDE PRO $20; NO EXTRA API BILLS<br/>No arbitrary 30% target; no quota evasion<br/>Claude chat cannot silently switch models"] -. "Hard boundary" .-> DIRECTOR
